    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "How is it going? Do you have any new hobbies or interests to try out?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:30:56.570898+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "That's wonderful to hear! I just started playing violin this year. It's really enjoyable and relaxing.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:31:16.897257+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "That's really cool! What kind of music do you like to listen to?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:31:43.007295+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Wow, that's really cool. I just started playing violin this year.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:32:05.115043+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Emily, I love the way you talk. Can't wait to get to know you better.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:36:14.854423+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Oh, it's great that we could talk! What about you?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:39:20.526921+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "You know, Emily. I always thought that music was a beautiful and diverse art form. Do you think there is any particular genre or style of music that you particularly enjoy?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:39:54.498275+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "I am really glad to hear that! I have been trying out various music genres and styles lately. Do you prefer classical, jazz, or electronic music?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:41:06.015292+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Emily, I've been listening to your music recently and it really caught my attention. Do you have any favorite songs or albums that you can recommend?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:43:57.918135+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "Yeah, I love a lot of genres but I think classical is my favorite because it's so expressive and emotive.",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:45:16.783461+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "from_id": 2,
      "from_name": "Olivia",
      "to_id": 1,
      "to_name": "Emily",
      "content": "Emily, I'm really glad to hear that you enjoy classical music. It sounds like it's a great choice for you! What are some of your favorite classical composers or symphonies?",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:49:45.224485+00:00"
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "from_id": 1,
      "from_name": "Emily",
      "to_id": 2,
      "to_name": "Olivia",
      "content": "What's your favorite classical composer? Or perhaps a symphony of yours. I love those pieces!",
      "created_at": "2026-09-04T23:52:37.374224+00:00"
    }
